        "16643784382605f677-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is traxxas?",
            "answer": "<p>Traxxas has been around since 1986, and they are known for their high quality products. They're ready to run (RTR) radio controlled vehicles that cater toward all skill levels; whether you're new or experienced!</p><p>With Traxxas, you can go as fast and wild with your car or boat - it's a passion that never ends! For those looking for some new ways to spend time playing around outdoors then this is one hobby they should consider.</p><p>With an operation set up in Texas, Traxxas has quickly become one of the globally recognized leaders for radio-controlled vehicles. Thanks to Hearns Hobbies you can find everything from RC boats and parts right here at home!</p>"
          }
        },
        "16643784382605f677-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the Traxxas Range of Models?",
            "answer": "<p>When you're looking for the ultimate in radio-controlled vehicles, there's only one name that comes to mind: TRAXXAS. With products like RC cars and accessories available in addition with our batteries at great prices - it doesn't get much better than this!</p><p>Hobbyists will be delighted by the wide variety of products available at Traxxas Australia. From electric monster trucks, catamarans and supercars to short course trucks or even RC buggies; there is something for everyone!</p><p>Hearns Hobbies has the full range of Traxxas for sale form rc buggies, rc monster trucks all the way to the large scale Traxxas XMaxx.</p><p>Some the most poluar models are the Traxxas Bandit, Traxxas Ruslter, Traxxas E-Revo and the Traxxas TRX4 Land Rover Defender.</p>"
          }
        },
        "16643784382605f677-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What size are traxxas cars?",
            "answer": "<p>Traxxas has a range of 1/16, 1/10 and 1/8 scale rc cars. The sizes varies a lot from model to model however about 20cm all the way to to 1m in length.</p>"
          }
        },
        "16643784382605f677-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How fast are Traxxas cars?",
            "answer": "<p>Generally speaking traxxas cars brushed can reach a speed of about 45kmh. The Traxxas VXL Brushless range and go as fast as 100kmh.</p>"
          }
        },
        "16643784382605f677-6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much is a Traxxas Car?",
            "answer": "<p>Depending on the vehicle you’re after, you can buy Traxxas for anywhere between $299 and $1,599.</p>"
          }
        },
        "3b514555-51cf-4b72-b8d6-3776e99f5eb9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you repair Traxxas Cars?",
            "answer": "<p>Hearns Hobbies also stocks spare parts in order to repair your Traxxas vehicle.</p><p>We also stock upgrade parts such as wheels, tries, batteries and alloy pats to take your veichle to the next level.</p>"
          }
        }
